Package: rs-telex
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: duyphan0503 <https://github.com/duyphan0503>
Homepage: https://github.com/duyphan0503/rs-telex
Depends: ibus (>= 1.5)
Description: High-performance Vietnamese Telex IME for Linux/IBus written in Rust
 rs-telex provides smooth, flicker-free Vietnamese Telex typing with
 intelligent syllable validation and automatic programming keyword pass-through.
 Supports Ubuntu (GNOME + Wayland/X11).
